      "Colleague 8 (Primary)": "Assigned to Colleague 2 (me) and Colleague 9. Validate their Canto 1 catch, then use their own parental death observation to argue why Option 4 fits Canto 1's orphanhood sequence far better than the broad, generic Option 5.",
